:INFO
Art. 58
1 Any person who violates the duty to notify under Article 15 paragraph 1 or 3 is liable to the penalties under Article 86 paragraph 3 RailA.
2 Any person who violates the duty to notify under Article 17 paragraph 1 is liable to the penalties under Article 91 paragraph 1 letter i CAA.
|

:NOTE
Para. 1 — Amended by No I of the O of 13 Sept. 2024, in force since 1 Jan. 2025 (AS 2024 511).

